Panels A, B, and C are generated together by Analyses/Jupyter_notebooks/Figure3.ipynb and exported to Fig3_panels_ABC.pdf.
Panel D is built in PowerPoint (Fig3_panel_D.pptx) and exported to Fig3_panel_D.pdf.

The two PDFs are composed and annotated in Affinity Designer (Fig3.afdesign) and exported to the final Fig3.pdf. The notebook draws a 'd' placeholder label at the position where panel D should sit in the final composition.

For tuning the Fig3_panels_ABC layout, see ../../HANDOFF.md.
